        depth = 1,
        instruction = "Zoning after the quest is complete but your reward is not obtained (EG: Key Ring Belt is in your Mog Safe, you choose the Lucky Charm to reobtain the belt, unlock the switches and get the, \"Come back after sorting your inventory.\" message) you will have to repeat the entire quest. You can just click the??? again if you drop the belt without having to zone without repeating the quest.",
